# {{projectName}}

Built with SvelteKit (File-Based Routing) + Svelte 5 runes.

## Stack
- **Framework:** SvelteKit
- **Language:** TypeScript
{{#if useTailwind}}
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 4
{{/if}}
{{#if useTests}}
- **Tests:** Vitest
{{/if}}
{{#if useE2E}}
- **E2E:** Playwright
{{/if}}

## Commands
```bash
npm run dev      # Start dev server
npm run build    # Production build
npm run preview  # Preview production build
{{#if useTests}}
npm test         # Run tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useE2E}}
npm run test:e2e # Run E2E tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useLint}}
npm run lint     # Lint code
npm run format   # Format code
{{/if}}
```

## Project Structure
```
src/
  routes/        # File-based routing
    +page.svelte # Home page
    +layout.svelte # Root layout
    {{#each modules}}
    {{this}}/
      +page.svelte   # {{pascalCase this}} page
      +page.ts       # {{pascalCase this}} loader
    {{/each}}
  lib/           # Shared utilities and components
  app.html       # HTML shell
  app.css        # Global styles
  hooks/         # Server hooks
```
